140:Typed fold/simplify and the A0 classification census are immediate uses of producer-supplied witnesses. Tix single-use inline is a second language instance of guarded rewriting with affine substitution and source occurrence lineage. B1 residual entry and D1 LICM preheader formation are immediate consumers of root-aware structural edits. Preserve generic matching alongside the native builders. Use explicit entry checks and region dominance validation. Tix expression projection and strict arithmetic rule evidence are testable extensions. A provenance witness from a legacy classifier should remain retrospective evidence with an explicit origin. `src/typed/rules/passes.ts:14`, `A0-G/src/typed/edit-classes.ts:283`, `src/tensor/passes.ts:21`, `B1-G/src/typed/specialize-buffer.ts:294`, `src/typed/passes.ts:423`.
