The probe supports three concrete library boundaries. The shared solver matched RV32 register liveness on a four-block diamond. Typed and Tix differed on `max(NaN, 7)`, so shared binary32 helpers need explicit operation semantics. And the direct Tix affine helpers rounded an intermediate even though the final mathematical result fit in a safe integer.
