| **Domain or target** | Keep the interpretation of an IR, its memory and effect model, what a workload means, and target-specific policy with the people who can state and test those assumptions. A library client supplies semantic parameters or a narrow projection. | Typed supplies variable and trap semantics, guest memory, instruction classes and ABI. Tix supplies binding and shapes, affine access extraction, math-operation semantics, CUDA emission, and execution. The measurement adapter chooses whether it can observe counts, events, or only elapsed time. `src/typed/analyses.ts:29`, `src/typed/evaluate.ts:351`, `src/typed/backend/encode.ts:364`, `src/tensor/model.ts:31`, `src/tensor/evaluate.ts:61`, `src/tensor/cuda-runtime.ts:106`. |

